    editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - guid: 17d50113-8f08-4ad1-949b-dddf40df93c9
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: And when did you get here, man?
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: 4a78c1b7-42b9-46d3-95d1-2d3e229dd661
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: To Erlin's Eye, that is.
      delaySeconds: 2.1
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: fbc974f6-ae0b-4e2f-baa9-18e1ca826758
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Does it get any easier?
      delaySeconds: 1.9
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 08f71d46-6727-4d9e-9b39-a8b015453382
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I've been here a few days now, and still just as clueless as when I got here.
      delaySeconds: 1.8
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: f8cb46e3-1166-4525-80d0-da39e46c92cb
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: It's strange, this place feels like home, yet I recognise nothing at all.
      delaySeconds: 3.8
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: d56ff768-2fcb-40a1-a2e9-f439176d27e4
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: But, at least I know you now, man, and this stall gives me refuge.
      delaySeconds: 3.6
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
  - guid: 6a357a1a-1002-472d-8ff3-accbc5f62320
    kind: 4
    line:
